Subject: [PATCH 290/333] [ae-patch] Show the Needs you count on the Admin
 Center sidebar row

A pill on the Admin Center nav row: the urgent count in red when anything is urgent, else
the review count in neutral, a question mark when a source could not be read or the route
is down, and nothing at zero. It reads GET /v1/ae/attention/summary once a minute while the
tab is visible and on focus. The logic is in new files (lib/aeAttention.ts and
components/AeAttentionBadge.tsx); ExtensionPrimaryNavigation.tsx passes the badge as the
row's trailing slot for the one nav id that has it. A sync that reworks PrimaryNavLink's
trailing slot is where this conflicts.
